Package: multigait
Title: Interface to the 'MultiGait' Wrist-Worn Gait Analysis Pipeline
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: 
    person("John", "Muschelli", , "muschellij2@gmail.com", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Provides an R interface to the Python 'MultiGait' package
    <https://github.com/DMegaritis/multigait>, a pipeline for estimating gait
    sequences, initial contacts, cadence, stride length, walking speed, and
    digital mobility outcomes from wearable inertial-measurement-unit data.
    Both complete, predefined pipelines and modular component functions are
    available.
